msgctxt "#31395"
msgid "With Bingie you can have all of your Kodi and library content in one place, through the use of widgets.[CR][CR]"
"Home widgets and hubs can be configured from:[CR]"
"[COLOR white]    - Skin settings -> Configure shortcuts[CR][CR]"
"The skin is pre-packed with widgets for movies & TV shows.[CR]"
"If you haven't added files to your video library yet, now is a good time.[CR]"
"Otherwise, you will start with TMDb Bingie Helper widgets.[/COLOR][CR][CR]"
"[COLOR ff41b957]TMDb Bingie Helper doesn't play any content by itself. To watch movies or TV shows, you need a separate plugin for that. If you want, you can then configure TMDb Bingie Helper to use it for playing content:[CR]"
"    - Skin settings -> Supported addons -> TMDb Bingie Helper -> Players[CR]"
"You can always replace the default skin widgets with your own.[/COLOR]"
msgstr "With Bingie you can have all of your Kodi and library content in one place, through the use of widgets.[CR][CR]Home widgets and hubs can be configured from:[CR][COLOR white]    - Skin settings -> Configure shortcuts[CR][CR]The skin is pre-packed with widgets for movies & TV shows.[CR]If you haven't added files to your video library yet, now is a good time.[CR]Otherwise, you will start with TMDb Bingie Helper widgets.[/COLOR][CR][CR][COLOR ff41b957]TMDb Bingie Helper doesn't play any content by itself. To watch movies or TV shows, you need a separate plugin for that. If you want, you can then configure TMDb Bingie Helper to use it for playing content:[CR]    - Skin settings -> Supported addons -> TMDb Bingie Helper -> Players[CR]You can always replace the default skin widgets with your own.[/COLOR]"

